This is a Guide which neatly narrows down the Flow of various Minigames to a minimum.

This will be expanded in the Future.

== Shades of Morton ==
This minigame is split into three diffrent Sub-Activities.

=== Gathering Sacred Oil ===

# Jump to World 377
# Buy [[Olive oil]] from [[Razmire General Store.|Razimre Keelgan]]
# Bank as much as you want to convert to [[Sacred oil|Sacred Oil.]]
# Equip full [[Graceful outfit|Gracefu]]<nowiki/>l except Legs with [[Morytania legs 3|Morytania Legs 3]] or [[Morytania legs 4|Morytania Legs 4]]
# Fill Inventory like this (Flamtaer Bag full of Material ([[Timber beam|Timber Beam]], [[Limestone brick|Limestone Brick]] and [[Swamp paste|Swamp Paste]])):
{{Inventory|Saw|Flamtaer hammer|Flamtaer bag|Tinderbox|Olive oil|Olive oil|Olive oil|Olive oil|Olive oil|Olive oil|Olive oil|Olive oil|Olive oil|Olive oil|Olive oil|Olive oil|Olive oil|Olive oil|Olive oil|Olive oil|Olive oil|Olive oil|Olive oil|Olive oil|Olive oil|Olive oil|Olive oil|Olive oil
}}
# Run to the [[Shades of Mort'ton (minigame)|Shades of Morton Temple]] 
# Reinforce until ~90% Sanctity.
# Light Flaming Fire Altar and spam click until [[Olive oil|Olive Oil]] turns to [[Sacred oil|Sacred Oil]]
# Teleport to [[Burgh de Rott]] with [[Morytania legs 3|Morytania Legs 3]] or [[Morytania legs 4|Morytania Legs 4]]
# Bank [[Sacred oil|Sacred Oil]] nearby and fill another 24with [[Olive oil|Olive Oil]]
# Repeat until all [[Olive oil|Olive Oil]] is gone.

